# AI Assistance Disclosure:
# Tool: Claude Code (model: Claude Opus 5.5), date: 2026-10-28, 2026-11-10
# Scope: Drafted local Admin settings for the database, User and Order connections; added the
# Order service credential.
# Author review: I validated correctness and supplied additional boundary checks.

ENVIRONMENT=development
# From `npx supabase status` in admin-service/. Never commit credentials.
# Host process: postgresql://<user>:<password>@127.0.0.1:17522/postgres
# An unset URL keeps liveness available but readiness returns 503.
DATABASE_URL=

# Fixed User origin for current-session checks (GET /v1/users/me).
USER_SERVICE_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
# Fixed Order origin for errand checks and the internal dispute routes.
ORDER_SERVICE_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8002
# Dedicated Admin-to-Order credential for the internal dispute routes. Must equal Order's
# ADMIN_SERVICE_SECRET. Unset: opening, withdrawing or deciding disputes returns 503.
ORDER_SERVICE_SECRET=
DEPENDENCY_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=2
